=== Daemon Integration Tests (with mock infra) ===

  ✓ dry-run flags violation in output but does not call declare-immoral
  ✓ dry-run with OK verdict does not flag
  ✓ skips already-flagged posts
  ✓ empty public text fails input validation before model evaluation
  ✓ reasoning-only model output is an observable failure and cannot flag
  ✓ processes multiple posts with mixed verdicts
  ✓ missing --portal-address exits with error
  ✓ --from cannot bypass durable moderation jobs
  ✓ non-dry-run calls declare-immoral via CLI
  ✓ reads policy from contract output
  ✓ rejects a local policy override instead of signing with fallback text
  ✓ warns on posts past the censor window
  ✓ warns on posts about to expire in censor window
  ✓ processes oldest unflagged posts first (censor window urgency)
  ✓ model cannot add a destination, operation or post index to a verdict
  ✓ failed signing is not reported as a completed successful job
  ✓ production CLI cannot bypass model isolation with skip-bootstrap
  ✓ old post policy fails closed without model or signer action
  ✓ empty contract policy fails closed without model or signer action
  ✓ restart retains completed decisions without re-evaluating or resubmitting
  ✓ submitted receipt without finality remains durable and restart does not resend
  ✓ historical policy bytes are used for an older post after policy update
  ✓ private fee configuration is mandatory at daemon startup
  ✓ Ethereum endpoint is mandatory at daemon startup

